<title>ITALY: CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA FOURTH STAGE TIMINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA FOURTH STAGE TIMINGS.</headline>
<dateline>OLBIA, Sardinia 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in the</p>
<p>210-km fourth stage of the Tour of Sardinia cycle race from</p>
<p>Alghero to Olbia on Saturday (Italians unless stated):</p>
<p>1. Jan Svorada (Czech Republic) 5 hours 23 minutes 3</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Sandro Giacomelli</p>
<p>3. Alessandro Bertolini</p>
<p>4. Roberto Petito</p>
<p>5. Vyacheslav Djavanian (Russia)</p>
<p>6. Massimiliano Mori</p>
<p>7. Nikolay Bo Larsen (Denmark)</p>
<p>8. Vassily Davidenko (Russia)</p>
<p>9. Alessio Barbagli</p>
<p>10. Claudio Chiappucci   all same time as Svorada</p>
<p>Leading standings:</p>
<p>  1. Petito 18 hours	16 minutes and 30 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Svorada			  9 seconds behind</p>
<p>  3. Chiappucci		    11 seconds</p>
<p>  4. Bertolini		     13</p>
<p>  5. Gabriele Missaglia	  14</p>
<p>  6. Djavanian		     19</p>
<p>  7. Armin Meier (Switzerland) 20</p>
<p>  8. Germano Pierdomenico	23</p>
<p>  9. Mori			    27</p>
<p> 10. Barbagli			same time as Mori.</p>
</text>
